#: app/templates/privacy.html:39
msgid ""
"This Privacy Policy explains how personal data is collected, used, "
"disclosed, retained, transferred, and otherwise processed when you access"
" or use the website, services, products, tools, and features offered by "
"findpdftool.online through the Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:40
msgid ""
"When you access or use the Service, we may collect personal data that you"
" provide directly to us, personal data collected automatically from your "
"device, and personal data generated through your interaction with the "
"Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:43
msgid ""
"The team behind findpdftool.online operates as the controller of your "
"personal data. For any inquiries regarding data processing, you can reach"
" us directly via the contact information provided below."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:46
msgid ""
"When you access our website, we may automatically collect information "
"from your device, including cookies, language settings, time zone, device"
" type and model, device settings, operating system, Internet service "
"provider, mobile carrier, hardware ID, unique identifiers such as IDFA "
"and AAID, and information about your interactions with the website."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:47
msgid ""
"We use this information to provide the Service, analyze how users "
"interact with the website, improve the Service, and measure advertising "
"performance."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:50
msgid ""
"To provide, improve, analyze, support, market, advertise, and process "
"payments for the Service, we use third-party solutions. These third-party"
" solutions may include Google Analytics, Google AdSense, Cloudflare, "
"Sentry, and trusted payment providers. As a result, some personal data "
"may be stored or processed on servers operated by such third parties."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:53
msgid ""
"We do not knowingly process personal data from persons under 16 years of "
"age. If you learn that anyone younger than 16 has provided us with "
"personal data, please contact us."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:59
msgid ""
"We collect personal data that you provide directly to us and personal "
"data that is collected automatically when you access or use the Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:62
msgid ""
"If you create an account or contact us, we may ask you to provide your "
"email address. This email address may be used to create your profile, "
"identify your account, and send details related to your payments or "
"support requests."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:63
msgid ""
"You may also provide your email address when you contact our support team"
" or when you choose to receive marketing communications. Other personal "
"data may be included in documents that you upload to the website if those"
" documents contain personal data."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:66
msgid ""
"If you upload a document without subsequently registering an account, we "
"temporarily process the content of that document solely for the purpose "
"of providing the requested Service function. Such files are automatically"
" and permanently deleted from our systems within 1 to 2 hours of upload."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:69
msgid ""
"We may collect information about how you found us, including the "
"referring app, website, advertisement, URL, or other source from which "
"you reached the website."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:72
msgid ""
"We may collect device and technical information, including language "
"settings, IP address, time zone, device type and model, device settings, "
"operating system, Internet service provider, mobile carrier, and hardware"
" ID."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:75
msgid ""
"We may collect information about how you interact with the Service, "
"including pages viewed, features and content used, frequency of use, time"
" spent on the website, purchases, and other interactions with the "
"Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:78
msgid ""
"Our service providers may collect advertising identifiers when you access"
" the website from a mobile device. Depending on your device and operating"
" system, these identifiers may include Apple Identifier for Advertising "
"(“IDFA”), Identifier for Vendor (“IDFV”), or Google Advertising ID "
"(“AAID”). You can typically reset these identifiers through your device "
"settings, although we do not control those settings."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:81
msgid ""
"When you make payments through the Service, you may be required to "
"provide financial account data, such as your credit card number, directly"
" to our third-party payment service providers. We do not collect or store"
" your full credit card number. However, we may receive limited "
"transaction-related information, including the date, time, and amount of "
"the transaction, and the type of payment method used."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:89
msgid ""
"A cookie is a small text file stored on a user’s computer or device for "
"record-keeping purposes. Cookies may be session cookies or persistent "
"cookies. A session cookie expires when you close your browser and may be "
"used to make it easier for you to navigate the Service. A persistent "
"cookie remains on your device for a longer period of time."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:92
msgid ""
"We may also use tracking pixels and similar technologies that set or rely"
" on cookies to assist with delivering, measuring, and improving online "
"advertising."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:95
msgid ""
"Cookies may be used to recognize you automatically the next time you "
"visit the website. As a result, information that you previously entered "
"in certain fields on the website may automatically appear the next time "
"you use the Service. Cookie data may be stored on your device, usually "
"for a limited period of time."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:98
msgid ""
"Cookies and similar tracking technologies may be used to collect "
"information about your device, browser, activity, interactions with the "
"Website, advertising performance, and interactions with ads. You may be "
"able to limit or block cookies, or prevent your browser from accepting "
"cookies altogether, by changing your browser’s cookie settings. These "
"settings are usually available in the options, preferences, or similar "
"menu of your browser."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:104
msgid "We process personal data for the purposes described below:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:106
msgid "To Provide the Service:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:106
msgid ""
"We process personal data to provide the Service and enable you to use its"
" functions. This includes supporting seamless use of the Service, "
"preventing or addressing errors and technical issues, creating accounts, "
"and processing personal data contained in documents uploaded to the "
"website."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:107
msgid "To Provide Customer Support:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:107
msgid ""
"We process personal data to respond to requests for technical support, "
"Service information, or other communications initiated by you. For this "
"purpose, we may send you notifications or emails about the Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:108
msgid "To Communicate With You About the Service:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:108
msgid ""
"We may communicate with you by email or other electronic means regarding "
"your use of the Service. These communications may include information "
"about the Service. To opt out of certain emails, you may follow the "
"instructions included in the footer of those emails."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:109
msgid "To Research, Analyze, Maintain, and Improve the Service:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:109
msgid ""
"We process personal data to better understand our business, analyze "
"operations, maintain the Service, improve existing features, develop new "
"products, test and improve offers, perform statistical analysis, and "
"understand how different categories of users interact with the Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:110
msgid "To Send Marketing Communications:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:110
msgid ""
"We process personal data for marketing campaigns. As a result, you may "
"receive information about our products, including special offers, new "
"features, and products available on the website. If you do not want to "
"receive marketing emails from us, you may unsubscribe by following the "
"instructions in the footer."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:111
msgid "To Personalize and Measure Advertising:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:111
msgid ""
"We and our partners may use personal data to tailor advertisements and "
"show them at relevant times. For example, if you visit our website, you "
"may later see advertisements for our products on Google or other "
"platforms."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:112
msgid "To Process Payments:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:112
msgid ""
"We provide paid products and/or services within the Service. For this "
"purpose, we use third-party payment processing services. As a result, you"
" are able to make a payment and we are notified that the payment has been"
" made. We do not store or collect your payment card details ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:113
msgid "To Enforce Terms and Prevent Fraud:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:113
msgid ""
"We process personal data to enforce our agreements and contractual "
"commitments, detect, prevent, and combat fraud, address unauthorized use "
"of the Service, and respond to non-compliance with our Terms and "
"Conditions of Use."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:114
msgid "To Comply With Legal Obligations:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:114
msgid ""
"We may process, use, or share personal data where required by law. This "
"may include responding to lawful requests from law enforcement agencies, "
"courts, regulators, or other public authorities."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:121
msgid ""
"We use third-party tools and service providers to operate, support, "
"improve, analyze, advertise, and process payments for the Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:124
msgid ""
"We use analytics tools to understand how users interact with the Service,"
" evaluate performance, identify trends, and improve the website and our "
"products. These tools include Google Analytics, which helps us research "
"and analyze use of the Service."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:127
msgid ""
"We use advertising and marketing tools to promote the Service, measure "
"advertising performance, and provide more relevant advertisements. These "
"tools include Google AdSense. Google AdSense allows us to deliver "
"tailored advertisements so that they appear to users based on their "
"activity. Google allows its users to opt out of Google personalized ads."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:130
msgid ""
"You may be able to influence or opt out of personalized advertising "
"through device, browser, and third-party settings. For example, on iOS, "
"you may go to Settings > Privacy > Apple Advertising; on Android, you may"
" go to Settings > Privacy > Ads. You may also find information and opt-"
"out options through industry resources, including the Network Advertising"
" Initiative and the Digital Advertising Alliance."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:133
msgid ""
"We use payment processing providers to enable purchases and process "
"payments through the Service, which may include Stripe or PayPal. Payment"
" card information is provided directly to our third-party payment "
"processors. We do not store or collect full payment card details "
"ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:139
msgid ""
"We share personal data with third parties that help us operate, provide, "
"improve, integrate, customize, support, and market the Service. We may "
"share personal data for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy and"
" with the parties described below."
